    <string name="reports_assumptions_title">About these numbers</string>
    <string name="reports_assumptions">Savings are illustrative estimates, not verified emissions measurements. Totals add the saved kg CO₂e and points stored with each activity; points are a separate demo score with no fixed conversion from kilograms. Weeks start on Monday; months follow the calendar. Category filters apply to all report totals and chart values. The leaderboard always compares all categories for the same period.</string>
    <string name="leaderboard_title">Community leaderboard</string>
    <string name="leaderboard_explanation">All categories for this period. Your points come from your activity history; friend points are stored period totals. Demo scores are illustrative snapshots, not live competitive rankings. Equal scores share a rank; tied rows have a stable order.</string>
